:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 17 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点密集地砸在雾角栈桥东侧的测深台木栏上，<<else>>退潮后的雾角栈桥东侧测深台木栏旁，<</if>>铸铁绞盘上缠着一卷标有水深结扣的浸蜡麻绳，底座石缝里卡着一枚红铜测深铅锤与一把水手撬刀。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_4"]>><span class="teal">对照先前在避风石坞记下的锚链节数，你一眼看准了测深铅锤盘的卡簧位。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_1 is 1>>
测深台木栏旁的红铜测深铅锤今日已起出归位，浸蜡麻绳盘绕整齐。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_17">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬出红铜铅锤 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_17">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_4'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($physique or 10000)) gte 11500>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_1_rew")>><<money 380>>铅锤底部的空心槽旋开，露出一卷早年水文测量员留下的防水银币。<<else>>红铜测深铅锤表面刻度清晰，底座石缝也清理得干干净净。<</if>><span class="green">你在测深台底座起出了水文员藏匿的红铜铅锤。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往沉船滩栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	撬刀尖在湿滑石缝边打滑，海浪溅湿了袖口。<span class="red">你退后半步擦干刀柄水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "盘收浸蜡麻绳 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_17">>
<<if (($swimmingskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_4'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($tending or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_1 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_0"] to 1>><<swimmingskill 2>><<gswimming>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_1_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>麻绳末端拴着一枚镌刻古航标方位的海事铜牌，你将这件航海旧物妥善收进包中。<<else>>浸蜡麻绳按十寻一结盘绕在绞盘上，丝毫不乱。<</if>><span class="green">你顺着水手结扣摸清了栈桥东侧的水深暗记。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浸蜡麻绳表面微滑，盘收第三圈时绳结松了半扣。<span class="red">你踩住绳尾重新理顺绳股。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 18 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜风呼啸的守塔人石屋二楼备品间里，<<else>>海光通透的守塔人石屋二楼备品间里，<</if>>樟木壁柜底层摆着一只装满备用石英灯罩的柳条筐，筐边搁着一瓶擦镜酒精与一柄黄铜卡尺。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_0"]>><span class="teal">顺着方才盘收浸蜡麻绳记下的水深结扣，你一眼认出了灯室备品柜的暗格层位。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_2 is 1>>
备品间的石英灯罩柳条筐今日已清点妥当，玻璃表面纤尘不染。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 19]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_18">
<<investigateicon>><<link "擦亮石英灯罩 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_18">>
<<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($tending or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_2 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_2_rew")>><<money 400>>柳条筐底垫着的绒布下露出一袋守塔人预留的灯具采买零钱。<<else>>石英灯罩擦得晶莹透亮，折射出耀眼的海面晨光。<</if>><span class="green">你把守塔人石屋的备用石英灯罩打理得焕然一新。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往海蚀回音廊 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石英灯罩内壁弧度较深，擦拭时指节碰响了筐沿。<span class="red">你扶稳柳条筐放轻了手劲。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "核对灯罩口径 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_18">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($maths or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_2 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_1"] to 1>><<swimmingskill 2>><<gswimming>>
	黄铜卡尺量出的口径分毫不差，备品型号全部核对完毕。<span class="green">你凭精密卡尺找出了备品间暗藏的折光配件。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 19]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	黄铜卡尺游标沾了一点海雾水汽，推拉时略显滞涩。<span class="red">你用干绒布擦净卡尺刻度杆。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 19 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>暴雨拍击着海蚀回音廊北侧的石壁风管口，<<else>>海风穿流的海蚀回音廊北侧石壁风管口前，<</if>>岩壁内嵌着一具利用海浪气压鸣响的青铜雾笛风门，旁边挂着一把长柄钩钥与一罐防锈羊脂。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_1"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才用黄铜卡尺量准的折光口径，你一眼找准了海蚀回音廊风管阀的铜盖。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_3 is 1>>
回音廊北侧的青铜雾笛风门今日已调校完毕，低沉笛声随潮汐起伏。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_19">
<<investigateicon>><<link "拨开雾笛风门 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_19">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_1'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($skulduggery or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_3 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_3_rew")>><<money 420>>风门后方的储气室托盘滑出，里面放着一卷港务局早年封存的防雾津贴银币。<<else>>青铜雾笛风门开合顺畅，海浪涌入时发出浑厚长音。<</if>><span class="green">你成功打开了海蚀回音廊的青铜雾笛储气室。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往沉船滩栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	风管内涌出一股潮湿逆风，震得长柄钩钥偏了半寸。<span class="red">你侧身避开风口稳住手腕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 19]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "抹羊脂润转轴 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_foghorn_19">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_1'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($science or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_3 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_2"] to 1>><<swimmingskill 2>><<gswimming>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_3_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>转轴暗槽里露出一枚刻着初代守塔人徽记的纯铜音哨片，你将其妥善收入贴身内袋。<<else>>防锈羊脂彻底润透转轴，青铜风门再无半点涩滞声。<</if>><span class="green">你用羊脂养护法取出了雾笛转轴暗藏的音哨片。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	防锈羊脂受海风吹拂略有些发硬，涂抹时不够匀称。<span class="red">你借掌心余温暖化羊脂盒。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 19]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 9 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜潮漫过断桅沉船滩西侧的旧救生艇滑道，<<else>>晴空下的断桅沉船滩西侧旧救生艇滑道旁，<</if>>石砌滑道尽头的铁架下锁着一只防水铜急救箱，旁边散落着一根撬锁铁钎与一盘涂焦油缆绳。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_2"]>><span class="teal">借着方才调校青铜雾笛风门时的气压手感，你一眼看出了断桅滩救生艇架的锁销方向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_4 is 1>>
旧救生艇滑道的防水铜急救箱今日已开启核验，滑道畅通。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_encounter_foghorn_9">
<<investigateicon>><<link "撬开急救箱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_foghorn_9">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_2'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11500 or (($skulduggery or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_4 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_4_rew")>><<money 440>>急救箱夹层里除了密封绷带，还存着一袋远洋商船留下的应急海事银币。<<else>>防水铜急救箱内壁干燥整洁，应急器物一应俱全。<</if>><span class="green">你开启了旧救生艇滑道尘封的防水急救箱。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往海蚀回音廊 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜卡扣被海盐蚀得发紧，铁钎挑动时滑脱了一下。<span class="red">你握紧铁钎防滑柄退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拖出铁架 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_foghorn_9">>
<<if (($swimmingskill or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_2'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($athletics or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_foghorn_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_3"] to 1>><<swimmingskill 2>><<gswimming>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_foghorn_4_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>铁架下方露出一只封存完好的古董航海六分仪木匣，你将这件珍贵旧物收进背包。<<else>>焦油缆绳拉动滑车顺畅无比，沉重铁架稳稳移至干处。<</if>><span class="green">你借滑车巧力起出了救生艇架下的古董六分仪。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	焦油缆绳在滑车槽边蹭了一下，滑轮未能一次吃力。<span class="red">你把缆绳拨正到滑车深槽。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>冷雨潇潇的雾角岛背风石坞浅滩上，<<else>>风平浪静的雾角岛背风石坞浅滩上，<</if>>生铁系船柱底座下压着一只铅封货单匣，柱旁搁着一把钢丝刷与一柄刻度分规。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_foghorn_3"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才拖出救生艇架时摸清的滑道坡度，你一眼认出了避风石坞系船柱下的暗格。</span><</if>>
