<<investigateicon>><<link "刷开牡蛎壳 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_foghorn_10">>
<<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_foghorn_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($athletics or 0)) gte 250>>
