<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_druid_1 is 1>>
迷雾石柱群东柱的弧形日影槽今日已清理查验，青石水盂澄澈。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_moment_druid_17">
<<investigateicon>><<link "清出槽内积土 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_druid_17">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_druid_4'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($history or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_druid_1 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_druid_1_rew")>><<money 380>>槽底暗格露出一只桦皮小包，里面装着古巡林人留下的贸易银币。<<else>>弧形日影槽清理得棱角分明，石纹古朴苍劲。<</if>><span class="green">你从迷雾石柱群的日影槽底起出了古巡林人藏银。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往迷雾石柱群 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	槽角卡着几颗坚硬碎石，鹿骨刮片挑动时震麻了指尖。<span class="red">你先用树枝拨松碎石。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "注水观石影 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_druid_17">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_druid_4'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($willpower or 0)) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_druid_1 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_druid_0"] to 1>><<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	清泉填满弧形石槽，宛如一弯新月镶嵌在石柱根部。<span class="green">你借水影折光在石柱高处采获了珍稀白花地丁。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 18]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	青石水盂倾倒略急，日影槽水面激起一圈涟漪。<span class="red">你停手等待槽内水面平复。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
