<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "滤泉灌溉银蕨 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_moment_druid_18">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_druid_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($housekeeping or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_druid_2 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_druid_1"] to 1>><<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_druid_2_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>银背蕨叶片舒展，你剪下最肥厚的三片带孢子蕨叶收入随身药袋。<<else>>经白沙过滤的泉水清澈见底，银背蕨在林风中泛着银光。<</if>><span class="green">你用净泉护养法采到了上等的月泉银背蕨药叶。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 19]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
