:: MP Region Encounter Druid 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>星辉满天的深林古石环守林木屋前廊下，<<else>>松涛阵阵的深林古石环守林木屋前廊下，<</if>>樟木圆桌上嵌着一具绘有林间二十八宿的木质星盘，旁边摆着一盏蜂蜡灯与一束干艾草。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_druid_3"]>><span class="teal">循着白鹿离去时踏出的小径，你顺利找到了守林祭司木屋廊下的星象木盘。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回深林石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_druid_5 is 1>>
守林木屋前廊的木质星盘今日已校准完毕，蜂蜡灯火温暖明亮。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_encounter_druid_10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "对齐当季星位 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_druid_10">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_druid_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($maths or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_druid_5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_druid_5_rew")>><<money 460>>星盘中心弹出一只小木盒，里面盛着历代守林长老传下的护山银币。<<else>>二十八宿木齿精准咬合，星盘指向迷雾石柱群的东柱。<</if>><span class="green">你校准了守林木屋的二十八宿木质星盘。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往迷雾石柱群 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	木盘内圈受林间湿气影响微胀，转动时卡在了半格。<span class="red">你把蜂蜡灯移近烘去木盘湿气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "燃艾驱潮 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_druid_10">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_druid_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($willpower or 0)) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_druid_5 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_druid_4"] to 1>><<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_druid_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>廊柱暗格受热滑开，你从中取出一包陈年艾叶与山参须混合的护身草药收好。<<else>>艾草暖烟袅袅升起，整座守林木屋笼罩在令人安心的药香中。<</if>><span class="green">你用艾草熏烘法开启了廊柱暗格并取得陈年药包。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	干艾草刚点着便被廊下夜露潮气压住了火头，白烟微弱。<span class="red">你扇动火折子让艾草充分阴燃。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

