	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "记恒星谱线 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_observatory_9">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_observatory_2'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($willpower or 0)) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_observatory_4 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_observatory_3"] to 1>><<science 2>><<gscience>>
	游标测微目镜的十字丝稳稳锁住谱线，观测精度极高。<span class="green">你在测算恒星谱线时取得了珍贵的纯铜光栅古件。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	游标测微目镜的视度环未对齐，十字丝看起来有些重影。<span class="red">你先旋动视度环直到十字丝清晰。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 9]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Observatory 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>晚星初现的旧天文翼楼钟楼露天连廊上，<<else>>微风清爽的旧天文翼楼钟楼露天连廊上，<</if>>石栏拐角处立着一座带经纬环的青铜赤道日晷，旁边放着一具水准气泡仪与一把软铜刷。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg7_observatory_3"]>><span class="teal">借着方才用纯铜光栅测准的太阳高度角，你来到钟楼连廊时一眼看清了赤道日晷的季节差。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回天文翼楼 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg7_observatory_5 is 1>>
钟楼连廊的青铜赤道日晷今日已调平校准，晷针指向分明。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续查探 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp_region_encounter_observatory_10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "垫铜片调日晷 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_observatory_10">>
<<if (($maths or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_observatory_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($athletics or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_observatory_5 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_observatory_5_rew")>><<money 480>>底座水平归零瞬间，石栏暗龛滑出一袋早年报时官封存的守钟银币。<<else>>水准气泡稳居中心圆圈，青铜赤道日晷与钟楼报时分秒合拍。<</if>><span class="green">你调平了钟楼连廊赤道日晷并取出报时官藏银。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往折光穹顶室 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	连廊石板历经风雨微有倾斜，调平螺母拧过了一丝。<span class="red">你垫入一片薄铜垫片辅助找平。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "刷去经纬铜绿 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp_region_encounter_observatory_10">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg7_observatory_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or (($tending or 0)) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg7_observatory_5 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg7_observatory_4"] to 1>><<science 2>><<gscience>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg7_observatory_5_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>经纬环合页下弹出一枚刻着十二星座的古董银质星历怀表章，你将其妥善收好。<<else>>软铜刷拂去岁月铜绿，经纬环上的精密赤纬刻度重现光彩。<</if>><span class="green">你在清理连廊日晷经纬环时寻获了古董银星历章。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续前往 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Observatory 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	经纬环上的百年铜绿结得颇牢，软铜刷第一遍未能刷透。<span class="red">你蘸了一点白醋软化铜绿。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Observatory 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
